sequenceDiagram
    actor Creator as 👤 Creator
    participant Browser as ⚛️ Browser
    participant NGINX as 🚦 NGINX
    participant VS as 🎬 Video Service
    participant PG as 🐘 PostgreSQL
    participant Kafka as 📨 Kafka
    participant EW as 🎞️ Encoding Worker
    participant TW as 🖼️ Thumbnail Worker
    participant SUM as 🤖 Summarization

    Creator->>Browser: Click Upload, select video file
    Browser->>NGINX: POST /api/videos/upload
    NGINX->>VS: Forward request

    VS->>PG: INSERT video (status=uploading)
    VS->>VS: Save raw file to disk
    VS->>Kafka: Publish → video.uploaded
    VS-->>Browser: 201 Created ✅

    Note over Kafka,TW: Both workers receive the same event SIMULTANEOUSLY

    par Encoding (video quality versions)
        Kafka->>EW: Consume video.uploaded
        EW->>EW: ffmpeg → 360p HLS
        EW->>EW: ffmpeg → 720p HLS
        EW->>EW: ffmpeg → 1080p HLS
        EW->>PG: UPDATE video status=ready
        EW->>Kafka: Publish → video.processed
    and Thumbnail (preview image)
        Kafka->>TW: Consume video.uploaded
        TW->>TW: ffmpeg → thumbnail.jpg
        TW->>PG: UPDATE thumbnail_path
    end

    Note over Kafka,SUM: After encoding completes → AI kicks in

    Kafka->>SUM: Consume video.processed
    SUM->>SUM: OpenAI Whisper → transcript
    SUM->>SUM: BART AI → summary text
    SUM->>PG: INSERT video_summaries
    SUM->>SUM: Cache in Redis (summary:{vid})

    Note over Creator,SUM: Video is now LIVE — ready to stream! 🎉
